sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Execution-node certificate enrollment
    accDescr: The node generates a private key locally. Only its certificate signing request goes to the offline CA. Issued certificates return to the node, which then authenticates to both ingress endpoints.
    participant Node as Execution node
    participant CA as Offline CA operator
    participant Ingress as Ingress A and B
    Note over CA: Keep CA private key offline
    Node->>Node: Generate key pair and CSR
    Note over Node: Keep node private key locally
    Node->>CA: Transfer CSR only
    CA->>CA: Verify identity and sign CSR
    CA-->>Node: Return node and CA certificates
    Node->>Node: Install issued certificates
    Node->>Ingress: Open outbound mutual TLS connections
    Ingress-->>Node: Authenticate the node
    Note over Node,Ingress: Work authorization uses a separate signing key
